EFG 2 R "Banks-Camerer-Porter (GEB 94), Game 1" { "Player 1" "Player 2" }
"Game 1 of the sender-receiver signaling game experiment in :cite:p:`BanCamPor94`.
This game has a unique Bayes-Nash equilibrium (a pooling equilibrium), used as
a baseline test of Nash behavior."

